&lt;h2&gt;Build the partnerships that power AI innovation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Partner Manager to expand our strategic alliances across EMEA and help accelerate our market impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a portfolio of leading global and regional systems integrators. Your mandate will be to turn these relationships into measurable pipeline, bookings and customer growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Sales, Marketing, Customer Success and the wider Alliances team, you will identify the partners with the greatest commercial potential, build focused plans with them and create a consistent flow of qualified opportunities for Coveo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;As our Senior Partner Manager, you will:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the EMEA partner strategy for your assigned partners with clear targets for partner sourced pipeline, bookings, and partner productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with executive stakeholders across strategic partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build joint business plans with partner leaders that define target accounts, revenue objectives, sales plays, investment commitments and measures of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Marketing to deliver focused campaigns and events tied to target accounts, pipeline creation and measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular partner business reviews, assess performance against agreed objectives and redirect resources when a relationship is not producing sufficient results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Coveo with credibility across the EMEA partner ecosystem and communicate a compelling commercial proposition for Coveo’s AI powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Alliances, Partnerships, or Channel Management within an enterprise Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) environment, ideally with exposure to e-commerce, customer service, or search technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building and managing relationships within the SI/GSI ecosystem, including organizations such as &lt;em&gt;Accenture&lt;/em&gt;, Deloitte Digital, &lt;em&gt;Slalom&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em&gt;Capgemini&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success developing and executing partner strategies that generate measurable referral, pipeline, and bookings growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement, including the ability to assess partner potential, prioritise resources and focus activity on opportunities most likely to convert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to establish senior relationships while remaining closely involved in opportunity creation and deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with strong autonomy, perseverance, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and the ability to navigate complex organizations while influencing executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly motivated, accountable and entrepreneurial approach, with the resilience to build momentum in a fast moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and influencing skills across partner executives, sellers, delivery leaders and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience, adaptability, and a collaborative approach that contributes to both partner and team success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description was written by humans, assisted by AI. We may leverage technology in our hiring process to help us see the person behind the resume.&lt;/p&gt;
